  "name": "save-boot-26a-materia-list-gap",
  "description": "#246 (acceptance, hypothesis H1): the Materia list keeps empty inventory slots in place, so list index = inventory slot. Load harness/saves/disc1-md1stin-materia-gaps.json (Cloud alone, materia slots empty, materia 49 in inventory slots 0, 3 and 5 only, AP = slot), open the field menu, plan the main-menu cursor 0 to 2 (semantic/menu-panel.js), Circle every 60 frames until menu_ovl reads 3 (ovl_wait), 120 frames, Circle (opens the list for weapon slot 0, #241) and 60 frames; the list row and offset read 0 (#244). Down 3 times, each a 4-frame press, a wait of at most 30 frames for the list row to read the next index (w_row3 for the last; under H2, a compacted list, the row stops at 2 and that wait fails), then 10 frames. Then mark, Circle, and wait until inventory slot 3 reads empty (eq_wait). Checks: slot 3 empty and changed since the mark (took_ok), slots 0 and 5 unchanged, Cloud's weapon slot 0 holds slot 3's word 0x331, the offset still 0, still on overlay 3 in the menu, a rerun matches. Reports the raw list row at the end. Only frame counts, 1/0, indices and author-chosen words leave.",
